        "Description": "47.\r\rYou are assigned the following High Value Targets (HVTs) at the Gama Medical Facility in Hokkaido, Japan. Below are the listed targets and the preferred kill methods.\r\rAgent Carlton Smith: Eliminate with a headshot from a pistol.\rDr Katashi Ito: Eliminate with injected lethal poison.\rYoga Instructor J. Brooke: Eliminate with Fibre wire.\rPatient Amos Dexter: Eliminate by drowning.\rDirector Akira Nakamura: Eliminate with an explosive device.\r\rProceed with discression. \r\rGood luck!\rReapingZ",
